<title>CHINA: GILBERT YEAR NET PROFIT UP 12 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>GILBERT YEAR NET PROFIT UP 12 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   22.8     vs 23.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.0	vs 4.8</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    79.84    vs 71.23</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,192.49 vs 850.04</p>
<p>    Company name		 Gilbert Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 8-11</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 15</p>
<p>NOTE - Gilbert Holdings is a flax trader.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is seven H.K. cents (including interim dividend of two cents) vs 4.8 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
